1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:08,400
Read the lesson together with teacher.

2
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:14,880
The Turtle and the Rabbit

3
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:21,000
The Turtle and the Rabbit race.

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:29,520
The Rabbit thinks it runs fast, no need to hurry.

5
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:39,560
It chases butterflies, looks at flowers for a long time then runs.

6
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:52,560
The Turtle knows it runs slow so it is diligent, tries hard to run really fast.

7
00:00:53,800 --> 00:01:01,920
That's why the Turtle arrives at the finish line before the Rabbit.

